- Role: Fighter, Assassin
- Lane: Jungle, EXP
- Specialty: Burst, Control
- Difficulty: Medium
- Tier this patch: C
- Win rate: 48.91%
- Pick rate: 0.48%
- Ban rate: 1.65%
