- Uranus (Tank): +3.4 pp edge. Across Yin's measured matchups, Yin is weakest in the early game. Apply pressure with Uranus before Yin can scale.
- Hilda (Fighter/Tank): +2.9 pp edge. Hilda's sustain and durability allow them to outlast Yin's burst combos and win extended trades.
- Gloo (Tank): +2.7 pp edge. Across Yin's measured matchups, Yin is weakest in the early game. Apply pressure with Gloo before Yin can scale.
- Khaleed (Fighter): +2.5 pp edge. Khaleed's sustain and durability allow them to outlast Yin's burst combos and win extended trades.
- Lancelot (Assassin): +2.2 pp edge. Across Yin's measured matchups, Yin is weakest in the early game. Apply pressure with Lancelot before Yin can scale.
- Johnson (Tank/Support): +2.2 pp edge. Johnson's crowd control can lock down Yin's mobility, shutting down engages before they start.

