## Curated builds

Reviewed against patch 2.1.67 on 2026-05-13. The live patch is 2.2.16a, so these have not been re-read against it yet.

### Jungle Pickoff Default (Jungle)

- Items: Tough Boots, War Axe, Hunter Strike, Blade of Despair, Malefic Roar, Immortality
- Core: War Axe, Hunter Strike, Blade of Despair
- Emblem: Assassin Emblem with Rupture, Seasoned Hunter, Killing Spree
- Battle spell: Retribution
- Blessing: Ice Retribution
- Flex: Warrior Boots over Tough Boots when Use when the enemy draft is mostly physical and crowd control is not the main reason your domain fails.; Sea Halberd over Malefic Roar when Use when the isolated target relies on healing, shields, or high extra HP more than armor stacking.; Rose Gold Meteor over Immortality when Use against magic burst when the Lifeline shield saves the first entry better than a delayed revive.; Queen's Wings over Immortality when Use when Yin is ahead but the target survives long enough that a low-HP damage reduction window matters.
- Total cost: 12000 gold

Default jungle setup for reaching level four on time, isolating a carry with Ice Retribution, and converting one domain kill into reset tempo.

### EXP Isolate Burst (EXP)

